The workspace also includes diagram sources, rendered previews, QA outputs, and helper scripts used to prepare documentation. These are working artifacts; the linked documents above are the recommended starting points.

## Viewing and contributing

- Use a Word-compatible editor for `.docx` files.
- Use diagrams.net for `.drawio` diagrams.
- Keep requirements, use-case names and IDs, module assignments, and architecture diagrams consistent when changing project scope.
- Mark proposed design decisions clearly and record unresolved permissions or integration questions before implementation.

There are no application installation steps, runtime commands, or automated tests documented for this repository because a complete application implementation is not included.
